# ${project_name}

${project_description}

Non-IaC, non-k8s configuration for homelab infrastructure: Talos node
configs, network topology docs, Proxmox layouts, on-prem server notes.

## Layout

```
talos/         # Talos node configs (consumed by homelab/tf-live regen)
network/       # network topology, switch configs
proxmox/       # Proxmox VM layouts, storage notes
servers/       # bare-metal server inventory + provisioning notes
```

This is a catch-all for things that don't fit `homelab/k8s`,
`homelab/tf-modules`, or `homelab/tf-live` but still belong in version
control.
